summary.label:
With the myTransdev free app, checking the bus schedules of the lines operated by Transdev Portugal is easy and fast.

Main features:
- Search bus schedules and prices;
- Check the next buses in each bus stop;
- Identify the nearest stops;
- Check bus routes, also on Google Maps;
- Plan your trip, including the need for change of bus.

Additional information:
- Contacts;
- FAQ.
